        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.1.1+JOB.1.2+JOB.1.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yobu 1.1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yobu agisabira bagenzi be, Uwiteka aherako aramwunamura amukiza ibyago bye, amuha ibihwanye n'ibyo yari afite kabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko abavandimwe bose bamusangana na bashiki be bose, n'abari baziranye na we bose basangirira na we mu nzu ye; baramuririra kandi baramuhumuriza ku bw'ibyago Uwiteka yari yaramuteje byose. Umuntu wese amushumbusha igice cy'ifeza n'impeta y'izahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Uwiteka ahira Yobu ubwa nyuma kuruta ubwa mbere, agira intama ibihumbi cumi na bine n'ingamiya ibihumbi bitandatu, n'amapfizi ibihumbi bibiri n'indogobe z'ingore igihumbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abyara n'abahungu barindwi n'abakobwa batatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukobwa w'imfura amwita Yemima, uw'ubuheta amwita Keziya, n'uwa gatatu amwita Kerenihapuki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mu gihugu cyose nta bagore bari bafite uburanga bwiza nk'abakobwa ba Yobu. Nuko se abahera iminani hamwe na basaza babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yabyo Yobu amara imyaka ijana na mirongo ine, abona abana be n'abuzukuru be ndetse n'ubuvivi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yobu apfa ashaje ageze mu za bukuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
